omer et \u00eatre au plus pr\u00e8s des planches dessin\u00e9es.", "short_description": "Izneo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ivgtp4_9KqoQ7kNvwFKrXBx&_nc_oc=AdpYnaDq644zvPe52LghBkAIPJkhmbgZa3ZJQ-p5pcqXGrNVJGAkiFkRaWfxz1h5u_M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfxO-9ntaT-fTtiLHqD2ql1VY8amC7ztda3mVY3wfTbJqA&oe=69C90B74"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=tCsQrXTA9AoQ7kNvwGb9TkB&_nc_oc=AdrEVzPCZNeJjJAakIEpLMM5gKjXytl8mDoz3Y0eT9Iz9FxD_Hc94zZ2i9OA8GKso3A&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Afwwe6Phd7cUkyoiSUgz0QSFD3e_Iq9rRgWph2H_UgAecQ&oe=69C90CD6"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=o_175YN9VqoQ7kNvwEpwfXl&_nc_oc=AdrG9KfPZDBSLKeZeo0uEL-_riy4yDrOvNcw0Sba0f1D_kSlD9la8xWsZmTwKGD2ImM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfzlGAqx3abrx3v8QhJXEmnY3Z2rs1tAdyAFBhyZLjbgYg&oe=69C921F7"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://